-tmp-p/sess.jsonl|2026-10-10T10:00:00.000Z|f4|q4|claude-opus-5-5|0|0|0|0|0|500|-
EOS
    deckel) cost_put "$_p" <<'EOS' ;;
# THE CAP. Context of a round: input + read + written cache. sess-1, one loop:
#   c1 100000, c2 102000, c3 104000 | u-1 | c4 50000, c5 52000, c6 54000 | u-2 | c7 70000, c8 82000.
# S, the first round after a compaction, median of c4 and c7: 60000, from 2.
# g, the pairs without a compaction between: c1-c2, c2-c3, c4-c5, c5-c6 2000 each, c7-c8 12000, sum 20000 over 5:
#   4000 (their median would be 2000; with the pairs across u-1 and u-2, -54000 and +16000, it would be -18000 / 7).
# K, measured: the write of c4 50000 * 8 = 0.40 and of c7 70000 * 8 = 0.56, mean 0.48. Estimated: preTokens 80000 and
#   120000, median 100000 * 0.2 = 0.02, postTokens 10000 and 20000, median 15000 * 20 = 0.30, 0.32. K = 0.80.
# r, the model of 8 of the 9 main rounds, claude-opus-5-5, reads at 0.2 (x1 in sess-2 ran claude-haiku-5-5, 0.01).
# Context of the main session, median of 1000 50000 52000 54000 70000 82000 100000 102000 104000: 70000, from 9.
# THE HAND, agent-h, is in none of them: y1 500000 and y2 900000 would add a pair of 400000 to g, its compaction u-h
# with y3 990000 after it a third S and a third pre and post.
USER|-tmp-p/sess-1.jsonl|2026-10-10T10:00:00.000Z|text
-tmp-p/sess-1.jsonl|2026-10-10T10:00:00.000Z|c1|q1|claude-opus-5-5|0|90000|10000|0|10000|0|-
